      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Dragon Castle\",\"louyang,218,253\")"
      ],
      "text" : "The {0} is located at ^0A82FF+^000000. It is where all the nobles reside, including our lord."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Luoyang Guide",
      "text" : "Since you're an outsider, I guess it would be appropriate for you to visit our lord first."
    },
