      "npc" : "Luoyang Guide",
      "text" : "is half the battle!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Luoyang Guide",
      "text" : "It's also safer to prepare yourself than to be sorry later. Why don't you go check their supplies?"
